  "$comment": "024 T008 [US1] — quickstart V4: default-on lane mapping on a ZERO-CONFIG team (config carries only the team identity — the load-time resolution pass materializes the C1.1 tables). The tracker team mirrors Linear's default workflow: Backlog/Todo/In Progress/Done/Canceled. status.events.jsonl sets one last-lane per work package: WP01 planned (issue todo -> Backlog), WP02 claimed (backlog -> Todo), WP03 in_progress (todo -> In Progress), WP04 done (started -> Done), WP05 canceled (todo -> Canceled), WP06 blocked (NO default counterpart — untouched + lane-state-unmapped), WP07 no lane events (untouched, no label; unmatched -> create carries no lane label). WP01..WP06 pre-exist with durable anchors and byte-identical mirrored descriptions so the lane move plans as an UPDATE with a clean description channel. A second plan+apply over unchanged inputs is a no-op (live types match the mapped ones).",
